// Declaration for //examples:09_component_functions — one sandboxed
// custom function, compiled to a WebAssembly Component-Model
// component by the cel_wasm_component macro.  The same declaration is
// mirrored by the embedder (FunctionLibrary in
// 09_component_functions.cc) so Engine::AddComponent can validate the
// component's exports against it.
//
// Scalar-only on purpose: string-RETURNING component fns currently
// trap inside libc++ under the wasi-preview2 stubs (see the skipped
// GreetRoundTripsString case in e2e/foreign_component_fixtures/
// cel_wasm_component_demo/demo_component_e2e_test.cc).  String
// *arguments* into scalar-returning fns work — see `len` in that
// fixture.

Module greeter;

int @component.add(int a, int b);
